  "answer": "I found no earlier ticket asking for `--secret` support (including `src=` file sources) in `wslc build`. The archive has no `wslc build` tickets at all, so this looks like a new feature request. The team can track it as one. Until it's added, you can't pass build secrets to a `wslc` build. Don't pass the secret as a build arg or copy the file into the image, because the secret can leak into image layers and history. If you can, run the build with Docker or Podman, which support `--secret id=...,src=...`. Otherwise, fetch the secret at runtime instead of baking it into the image."
 },
